Z||000001||Joe Torma||09-02-2001||11:25 AM||||You mean the wires that go to the ECM?? Take out the center console(screws behind the door, and under shifter piece), and unplug them from the ECM and feed through the hole.  The other bunch stays.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/simplesig.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by Joe Torma (edited 09-02-2001).]||||reg||1
